The numbers is a list of 2, 3, 1, 4, and 0.
The size is 5.
The best is 0, while the chosen is 0.
Set best to -1.
For every turn from 0 to 4.
The score is 0.
For every spot from 0 to 4.
The index is (spot plus turn) modulo size.
If item index of numbers is at most spot, add 1 to score.
If spot is 4 and score is more than best, set best to score, set chosen to turn.

Show chosen.
